== Prelude feature documentation

One file per Prelude feature will live here as `docs/prelude/<feature>.typ`.
For a new feature the file precedes the F\# reference implementation. For a
ported feature it is written before the Scale port begins, using the F\#
reference as its source.

The Scale port has not started, so this directory is intentionally empty. The
reference behavior lives in the F\# code under `components/prelude/evaluator/` and the current
decision records.
